<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Mississippi Chemical a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Mississippi Chemical a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--NatWest Securities analyst David Nelson said he upgraded Mississippi Chemical Corp to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>--He said he made the move &quot;due to the company's internally driven earnings expansion.&quot;</p>
<p>--Shares in the fertilizer concern were up 1/2 to 21-1/8.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
